    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pound, crush</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				977
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>beat one's breast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καττύπτεσθε, κόραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					62
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>beat one's breast for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὔκλειτον . . κατετύψατο μήτηρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					4.190
				</span></i>
			 (Halic., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>).</div>
